<span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Balanced</span></span>
<span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Efficiency-focused</span></span>
<span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Gradient-based(Ours)</span></span></span>
<span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Training RL <math id="S5.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t ltx_colspan ltx_colspan_4" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;"><em id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Accuracy <math id="S5.T2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math>   /   Response Length <math id="S5.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>   /   Clarity <math id="S5.T2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></em></span></span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_tbody">
<span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
