<th id="A1.T5.2.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">KL coefficient</th>
<td id="A1.T5.2.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.001</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.15" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T5.2.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Target layer IDs</th>
<td id="A1.T5.2.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.T5.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[10,11,12,\cdots,25]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[10,11,12,\cdots,25]</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.16" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T5.2.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Avg. training time</th>
<td id="A1.T5.2.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">24 hrs</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.17" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T5.2.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">GPU used</th>
<td id="A1.T5.2.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">8 Nvidia H200 (143 GB)</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Hyperparameters and other reproducibility information for gradient-based weight optimization.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use verl <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib36" title="" class="ltx_ref">Sheng et al., 2025</a>)</cite> for RL training. We obtain datasets and models from HuggingFace:</p>
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Math500 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lightman et al., 2023</a>)</cite>: <a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceH4/MATH-500" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceH4/MATH-500</a></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">MATH <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hendrycks et al., 2021</a>)</cite>: <a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/DigitalLearningGmbH/MATH-lighteval" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">https://huggingface.co/datasets/DigitalLearningGmbH/MATH-lighteval</a></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Qwen3: <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib48" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yang et al., 2025</a>)</cite>: <a href="https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-8B" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-8B</a></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Deepseek <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">DeepSeek-AI et al., 2024</a>)</cite>: <a href="https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/deepseek-llm-7b-chat" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/deepseek-llm-7b-chat</a></p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the hyperparameters used for GRPO training on Math500 in <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ A.5 Hyperparameters ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Learning to Optimize Multi-Objective Alignment Through Dynamic Reward Weighting" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 4</span></a> and <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ A.5 Hyperparameters ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Learning to Optimize Multi-Objective Alignment Through Dynamic Reward Weighting" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
